title Modern data platform
direction right

Sources [color: gray] {
  App database [icon: postgres, shape: cylinder]
  Clickstream [icon: analytics]
  CRM [icon: hubspot]
  Billing [icon: stripe]
}
Ingestion [color: blue] {
  CDC [icon: kafka, description: Debezium]
  Event collector [icon: segment]
  Batch loader [icon: airflow, description: Airflow]
}
Lakehouse [icon: databricks, color: orange] {
  Raw zone [icon: bucket, description: Bronze]
  Clean zone [icon: bucket, description: Silver]
  Curated zone [icon: bucket, description: Gold]
  Spark jobs [icon: spark]
}
Warehouse [icon: snowflake, color: lightblue] {
  Staging models [icon: dbt]
  Marts [icon: table]
}
Consumers [color: green] {
  BI dashboards [icon: dashboard, description: Looker]
  Reverse ETL [icon: sync]
  Data science [icon: python]
  ML features [icon: brain]
}
Data catalog [icon: book]
Quality checks [icon: check, color: red]

App database > CDC
Clickstream > Event collector
CRM, Billing > Batch loader
CDC, Event collector, Batch loader > Raw zone
Raw zone > Spark jobs > Clean zone > Curated zone
Curated zone > Staging models > Marts
Marts > BI dashboards, Reverse ETL, Data science
Curated zone > ML features
Reverse ETL --> CRM: sync back
Quality checks --> Clean zone, Marts: validates
Data catalog -- Lakehouse, Warehouse
